<title>FRANCE: Technip raises 96 net dividend.</title>
<headline>Technip raises 96 net dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>French engineering group Technip said on Friday it would pay a net dividend of 10.50 francs per share against nine francs per share in 1995.</p>
<p>The company made the announcement in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
